    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5.2b">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 5.2b</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gyf man gehadodne mid fæhþe belecge ⁊ secge þæt he wære dædbana oððe rædbana, ladige mid his magum þe fæhðe moton mid beran oððe forebetan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if a man in holy orders is charged with vendetta and accused of having committed or instigated homicide, he shall clear himself with the help of his kin, who must share the vendetta with him or pay compensation for it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gyf man gehadodne mid fæhþe belecge ⁊ secge, þæt he wære dædbana oððe rædbana, ladige mid his magum, þe fæhðe moton mid beran oððe forebetan.</ab>
      </div>
